00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:37.700
So even on the level of physiological changes in the brain,

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:41.080
we're looking at the same changes just as some people use

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.300
and need chemicals to achieve those changes,

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:44.890
other people get it through behaviors.

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:48.210
But the gambler is still after dopamine hit,

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:50.910
dopamine being the incentive motivation chemical.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.530
He's not after the money, 'cause it was

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.870
about the money he would quit

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.920
after he won his first jackpot.

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:57.990
Right?

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:59.760
