00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:03.480
that he gets, that temporary state of elation and excitement

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.690
that he gets when he's engaged in the activity.

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:10.690
So, all addictions whether they're behaviors

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:12.500
or substances or whatever they are,

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:16.810
they serve the same psychological purpose of escape

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.360
from suffering and pain, discomfort with the self.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:23.160
And they activate the same brain circuits

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.240
with the same neurochemicals.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.620
So there's only one universal addiction process.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:33.140
Drug addiction being a small, small manifestation of that.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.380
