00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:45.740
and why the conversation around it has to do with judgment

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.263
and shame and criminology.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.860
Well, I think if you wanna explore

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.610
