And so what it is is that when there's something

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.963
we don't like about ourselves,

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:26.190
then we'll look at that same thing as somebody else

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:29.490
and reject it and imagine that we're different.

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:31.140
