00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.430
to the drug addict.

00:16:51.430 --> 00:16:56.180
And yet the dynamic is the same which is being in the grip

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:58.500
of a compulsion that you can't control.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.250
And that has negative consequences,

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.470
and you don't have the power at least you perceive

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:06.540
that you don't have the power to regulate yourself.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.120
And so we see that in somebody else.

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:12.990
