00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.400
many more things happen

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.000
that further affects brain development

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.950
so that the first fact to really recognize here,

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:54.450
which is again is not taught in the medical schools yet,

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:55.799
even though scientifically

00:18:55.799 --> 00:18:59.120
it's not even vaguely controversial anymore.

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:00.840
Is that the brain develops an interaction

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:02.000
