00:19:28.735 --> 00:19:30.960
where the child is always around adults

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.870
who're looking after him.

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:35.040
Not that I wanna romanticize the past

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.540
