sexual exploitation, abandonment, neglect,

00:20:15.196 --> 00:20:19.410
emotional torment that plays havoc not only

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:21.210
with the personality development,

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.890
not only does it give you a lot of pain

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:26.070
that later you have to just sued somehow,

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.835
but it also distorts your brand development.

00:20:28.835 --> 00:20:30.940
And then, so now you have the template for addiction.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:31.940
Right and so,

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.720
I mean, what happens specifically

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:38.720
